// expect: 5.960464477539063e-8 1.1641532182693481e-10 0.00006103515625 1152921504606847000
// expect: 9.5367431640625e-7 0.30000000000000004
// The shortest digits that round-trip, as ECMAScript's Number::toString (#184): below a power of
// two the doubles are twice as dense, so the correctly rounded digits may not round-trip while the
// next decimal does (2^-24 is 5.960464477539063e-8, not 5.9604644775390625e-8).
println(`${2.0 ** -24.0} ${2.0 ** -33.0} ${2.0 ** -14.0} ${2.0 ** 60.0}`)
println(`${2.0 ** -20.0} ${0.1 + 0.2}`)
